post.description:
Example creating a certificate using Elliptic Curve Cryptography

    {"name": "mycertificate", "cryptosystem": "EC", "curve": "prime256v1"}

Example creating a certificate using RSA Cryptography

    {"name": "myrsacertificate", "cryptosystem": "RSA", "size": 2048}

Example creating a key using Elliptic Curve Cryptography

    {"name": "myeckey", "cryptosystem": "EC", "curve": "prime256v1"}

Example creating a key using RSA Cryptography

    {"name": "myrsakey", "cryptosystem": "RSA", "size": 2048}

put.description:
**Note:** References to this key will be updated automatically, while it might be necessary to manually update the configuration in places where this key is used, but not referenced.

Example importing a key

    {"action": "import", "key": "-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----...-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----"}

Example rotating a key

    {"action": "rotate"}
